  "readmeFile": "package-readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "First version:\n- All 31 documented Moolre operations: mobile money collections (with the OTP flow), payment links, Payment IDs and bank collection accounts, transfers and name validation, wallets and transaction history, airtime and data, SMS and WhatsApp.\n- Payment webhooks: parsing and X-Moolre-Signature verification (HMAC-SHA256, constant time, replay window), one secret per wallet.\n- Money safety: calls that move money or send messages are never retried; an unknown outcome throws MoolreOutcomeUncertainException with your reference.\n- Several wallets through named clients (AddMoolre(name, ...) and MoolreClientFactory).\n- Dependency injection first, trimming and Native AOT compatible, credentials never logged.\n\nFull history: https://github.com/zhuwaafrica/moolre-dotnet-sdk/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
